{"game": "repo", "language": "english", "appid": 3241660, "month": "2026-04", "window": 3, "start_date": 1776297600, "end_date": 1776902399, "month_true_total": 2959, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-05 12:54:19 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "223877735", "author": {"steamid": "76561199699147801", "personaname": "chimkeep", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199699147801/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 126, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 126, "last_played": 1762835246, "avatar": "547edb877df90f23424106d565793f2ba4f0cd61"}, "language": "english", "review": "Only fun with friends, but then again im pretty sure you can only play with friends.\ni got [spoiler] tickled [/spoiler] by a [spoiler] dog [/spoiler] one day", "timestamp_created": 1776901809, "timestamp_updated": 1776901809, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223877348", "author": {"steamid": "76561198854692093", "personaname": "Macro Masterclass", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198854692093/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4913, "last_played": 1780727839, "avatar": "b3de7c459e64229138a269006c78185e9cb54cdf"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great co-op horror game with a mix of scary elements and entertainment. The maps have varying themes to keep things from feeling stale. The enemy designs are also creative and force you to strategize different plans based on who you encounter. You can get serious, optimize, and challenge yourself to survive as many rounds as possible or simply have a good time with friends while trying to survive a wide array of enemies and map hazards. As entertaining as the game can be, there's real pressure when you're all alone and you don't know where the monster that has wiped out your squad is. The devs also drop devlogs at a reasonable pace to keep the community informed and are open to feedback which is greatly appreciated. My mid-tier system is also a few years old and this game still runs well for me. After many hours I still look forward to my next session and I can confidently recommend this to anyone looking for a scary game to play with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1776901215, "timestamp_updated": 1776901215, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223875928", "author": {"steamid": "76561198996452443", "personaname": "nicolassantt_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198996452443/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 669, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 669, "last_played": 1776800223, "avatar": "02824a7f6e98b080c3dafb134741aa49609895c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "bom ddms\n", "timestamp_created": 1776899216, "timestamp_updated": 1776899216, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223874291", "author": {"steamid": "76561199647288155", "personaname": "THE MIMIC!! 2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199647