layable from day 4. Strenght upgrades doesent appear at all in shop. I get killed instantly everytime i move bit far from spawn since 999 million monsters tend to harras you on every step and you're unable to kill them since only 1 explosive is mostly on sale in shop which doesent even kill the enemy completely.\nThese games shouldn't be about grinding and sweating. I wanna enjoy good time with friends I dont wanna get rage everytime i turn this game on.\nAtleast let me downgrade to first version 1.0 that was atleast playable since i could hold enemies how long i want which made the game beatable if you focused on strenght upgrades.\n\nYall devs did terrible job overwhelming the game with useless monsters that ruin the fun and make the game playable only by sweats", "timestamp_created": 1776895122, "timestamp_updated": 1776895122, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}]}